[% BLOCK it %][% begin_it %][% content %][% end_it %][% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
Hey so just to let you know I've been leaving my server to
handle HTTP/S requests for www.rapidcow.org and friends for
a while now!  Got new SSL certificates with certbot, also
learned how to use Fail2ban so IPs that spam the server
will be temporarily banned by the firewall.  This of course
is far from foolproof (imagine the DoS attacks[% ellip %]) but it
is a good starter I think. :)
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
(P.S. if i wasn't clear with that, it means the [% WRAPPER it %]server[% END %]
is working, but just the server[% ndash %]no content yet!)
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
And now that it is the end of holiday for me I'm gonna
be on a flight soon[% ellip %] it's been fun, yeah.  This system
administeration thing and archiving old media I found
around my house are all cool.  Sometimes it can feel like
a fever dream, a place familiar yet so distant[% ellip %].
[%- IF html %]</p>[% ELSE %]
[% END -%]

[% IF html %]<p>[% END -%]
